msgid ""
"Orbital spaces: The usual directives of Molpro for defining the orbital "
"spaces (``CORE``, ``CLOSED``, ``OCC``)  and the symmetry and spin of the "
"reference wavefunction (``WF``) can be used. By default the definition from "
"any previous command applies. Only CAS references are supported."
msgstr ""
"轨道空间：可以使用 Molpro 定义轨道空间（\\ ``CORE``\\ 、\\ ``CLOSED``\\ 、\\ ``OCC``\\ "
"）以及参考波函数的对称性和自旋（\\ ``WF``\\ ）的常用指令。默认情况下，应用先前任何命令中的定义。仅支持 CAS 参考。"

