msgid ""
"The command ``CMRCC`` calls the new Molpro implementation, currently "
"restricted to CAS(2,2). The command ``CMRCC,GECCO`` calls the external "
"program GeCCo. The command ``DF-CMRCC,GECCO`` calls the external program "
"GeCCo and uses density fitting for the integral transformation."
msgstr ""
"命令 ``CMRCC`` 调用 Molpro 的新实现，目前仅限于 CAS(2,2)。命令 ``CMRCC,GECCO`` 调用外部程序 "
"GeCCo。命令 ``DF-CMRCC,GECCO`` 调用外部程序 GeCCo，并对积分变换使用密度拟合。"

msgid "**``MAXIT=``\\ *value*** Maximum number of iterations."
msgstr "**``MAXIT=``\\ *\\ value*** 最大迭代次数。"

msgid ""
"**``SV_THRESH=``\\ *value*** Singular value decomposition threshold (default"
" 1E-7)"
msgstr "**``SV_THRESH=``\\ *\\ value*** 奇异值分解阈值（默认 1E-7）"

msgid ""
"**``MAX_EN=``\\ *value*** Highest order commutator included in the energy "
"equations (default: 4)"
msgstr "**``MAX_EN=``\\ *\\ value*** 能量方程中包含的最高阶对易子（默认：4）"

msgid ""
"**``MAX_RES=``\\ *value*** Highest order commutator included in the "
"amplitude equations (default: 2)"
msgstr "**``MAX_RES=``\\ *\\ value*** 振幅方程中包含的最高阶对易子（默认：2）"

msgid ""
"**``SELECT=``\\ *value*** Confine cubic and quartic commutator terms in "
"amplitude equations to those from single reference CC (default: True)"
msgstr "**``SELECT=``\\ *\\ value*** 将振幅方程中的三次和四次对易子项限制为来自单参考 CC 的项（默认：True）"

msgid "**``RELAX=``\\ *value*** Switch on reference relaxation (default: True)"
msgstr "**``RELAX=``\\ *\\ value*** 开启参考态弛豫（默认：True）"

msgid ""
"**``MAXDIIS=``\\ *value*** Maximum number of vectors for DIIS extrapolation "
"(default: 6)"
msgstr "**``MAXDIIS=``\\ *\\ value*** DIIS 外推的最大向量数（默认：6）"

msgid ""
"**``SHIFTI=``\\ *value*** Denominator shift for update of internal "
"configurations."
msgstr "**``SHIFTI=``\\ *\\ value*** 内部组态更新的分母位移。"

msgid "**``SHIFTS=``\\ *value*** Denominator shift for update of singles."
msgstr "**``SHIFTS=``\\ *\\ value*** 单激发更新的分母位移。"

msgid "**``SHIFTP=``\\ *value*** Denominator shift for update of doubles."
msgstr "**``SHIFTP=``\\ *\\ value*** 双激发更新的分母位移。"

msgid ""
"**``FILE=``\\ *filename(s)*** Filename or colon-separated list of filenames "
"with inputs for the external GeCCo program"
msgstr "**``FILE=``\\ *\\ filename(s)*** 外部 GeCCo 程序输入的文件名或以冒号分隔的文件名列表"

msgid ""
"Internally contracted multireference coupled-cluster (icMRCC) theory is "
"designed as a straight-forward generalisation of coupled-cluster theory to "
"multiconfigurational references. It also provides access to strictly spin-"
"adapted coupled-cluster energies for any open-shell case. As a downside, the"
" approach comes with significant computational overhead as compared to "
"standard coupled-cluster theory and potentially more problems concerning "
"convergence of the equations. The full approach is currently only available "
"as a pilot implementation using the GeCCo program (see below), a more "
"efficient version is currently restricted to doublet and CAS(2,2) singlet "
"and triplet wavefunctions."
msgstr ""
"内收缩多参考耦合簇（icMRCC）理论是作为耦合簇理论对多组态参考态的直接的推广而设计的。它还为任意开壳层情形提供严格自旋匹配的耦合簇能量。其缺点在于，与标准耦合簇理论相比，该方法具有显著的计算开销，并且可能在方程收敛方面存在更多问题。完整方法目前仅以使用"
" GeCCo 程序的试验性实现形式提供（见下文），更高效的版本目前仅限于双重态以及 CAS(2,2) 单重态和三重态波函数。"

msgid ""
"The GeCCo binary must be referenced by the environment variable "
"``$GECCO_BIN``; the environment variable ``$GECCO_DIR`` must also be set and"
" point to a path consistent with ``$GECCO_BIN``. The GeCCo program can be "
"downloaded from `GitHub <https://github.com/ak-ustutt/GeCCo-public>`__, see "
"there for further documentation."
msgstr ""
"GeCCo 二进制文件必须由环境变量 ``$GECCO_BIN`` 引用；还必须设置环境变量 ``$GECCO_DIR``\\ ，并将其指向与 "
"``$GECCO_BIN`` 一致的路径。GeCCo 程序可从 `GitHub <https://github.com/ak-ustutt/GeCCo-"
"public>`__ 下载，更多文档请参见该处。"

msgid ""
"The :doc:`Region <region>` command can be used to enable icMRCC computations"
" for large molecules, when only a fraction of it (for instance the "
"transition metal center and the coordinating orbitals) shall be correlated "
"at this level (virtual space truncation can be used in this case). The "
"approach should be combined with density fitting to cope with the integral "
"transformation (see :doc:`Region <region>` for details)."
msgstr ""
"当大分子中只有一部分（例如过渡金属中心及其配位轨道）需要在此级别进行相关计算时，可以使用 :doc:`Region <region>` 命令为 "
"icMRCC 计算提供支持（此时可使用虚空间截断）。该方法应与密度拟合结合使用，以应对积分变换（详见 :doc:`Region <region>`\\ "
"）。"
